            <ArticleTitle>Asthma management across the life span: the child with asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>635-52</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Childhood asthma has an adverse impact on children, families, and society. Treatment of asthma presents special challenges related to diagnosis, ongoing symptom monitoring, and treatment when the patient is a child. To be effective, treatment needs to be medically sound and developmentally appropriate.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
